Here's the ui-polish report.

## Final polish: invoice card

Replaced every raw colour, spacing, type and radius value with the matching token from `tokens.css`, added the one-primary/one-secondary action split, and added hover/focus-visible/disabled states and a 44 px click target. No text, elements or the brand hue changed.

### Fixes

**Tokens (R-ui-polish-20, 22, 34)**
1. `padding:13px` → `var(--space-12)` (13 is 1px from 12, 3px from 16 — nearest token).
2. `background:#ffffff` on `.card` → `var(--color-surface-raised)` (card surface, raised role).
3. `border:1px solid #e5e7eb` → `var(--border-width-hairline) solid var(--color-border-default)`.
4. `border-radius:5px` (card and buttons) → `var(--radius-md)` (5 is equidistant between 4 and 6; rule rounds up on a tie).
5. `font-family:system-ui` → `var(--font-family-sans)`.
6. `h2{font-size:22px}` → `var(--font-size-2xl)` (24px; 22 is equidistant between 20 and 24, rounds up).
7. `h2{margin:0 0 5px}` → `margin:0 0 var(--space-4)` (5 is 1px from 4, 3px from 8).
8. `h2{color:#111827}` → `var(--color-text-default)`.
9. `p{font-size:13px}` → `var(--font-size-md)` (16px; body text must be ≥16px, R-ui-polish-2).
10. `p{color:#999999}` → `var(--color-text-muted)` — the raw value failed contrast (2.85:1); fixed below.
11. `button{background:#0d9488}` → split into one primary action (`--color-action-primary-bg` / `--color-action-primary-text`) and one secondary action (`--color-action-secondary-text` / `--color-action-secondary-border`, transparent background), per R-ui-polish-5. Added `btn-primary`/`btn-secondary` classes as styling hooks only — no text or element changed.
12. `button{padding:6px 10px}` → `min-height:var(--size-target-min)` with `padding:0 var(--space-16)` (R-ui-polish-7, target was ~26px tall).

**States (R-ui-polish-6, 9)**
13. Added hover: primary → `--color-action-primary-bg-hover`; secondary → `--color-selected-bg` background.
14. Added `:active` press state on the primary button → `--color-action-primary-bg-pressed`.
15. Added `:focus-visible` outline: `var(--border-width-focus) solid var(--color-border-focus)`, 2px offset.
16. Added `:disabled` state: `opacity:0.5; cursor:not-allowed`.
17. Added background/border-color transition using `--duration-fast` / `--ease-standard`, turned off under `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`.

**Layout**
18. Added `margin-top:var(--space-16)` on buttons (separation from the paragraph) and `button + button{margin-left:var(--space-8)}` for the gap between the two actions — spacing only, no new elements.

